  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Finally. Took you long enough.
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dbac39fc5bdca074d874e5fd42ef71b0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - We have only been waiting a couple minutes.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Whatever. What are we doing again?
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9df70db75e70c354eb794e1e51029830, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Sorry for the wait.
    - We want to find a heating element. We should be able to get one from a radiator.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3617e0eefa6c664baad6c9c12a69e8b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Great, Let\u2019s get to it."
